## 6. The 3 Algorithms at a Glance

| Algorithm | Type | Best For | Unique Power |
|---|---|---|---|
| Decision Tree | Classification | Simple, explainable problems | Visual tree structure |
| Logistic Regression | Classification | Binary outcomes, probability scores | `predict_proba()` |
| Random Forest | Classification | Most real world problems | Feature importance, high accuracy |

